{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-426", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/426", "wordCount": 1517, "segments": [{"start": 12.0, "text": "I am Yuxin from Core ML."}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "Today I'm very excited to"}, {"start": 18.0, "text": "introduce a brand-new model in"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "Create ML this year, Activity"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "Classification."}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "We do lots of activities with"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "our devices every day such as"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "playing games, doing sports."}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "And our mobile devices have been"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "equipped with a very"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "rich set of sensors."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "Such as for motion,"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "Accelerometer and Gyroscope are"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "very commonly used."}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "And they can help us to detect"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "your device's three-dimensional"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "acceleration, rotation rate or"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "device orientation."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "And we could just use such sensor data"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "to represent our activities."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "For example, if you are jogging,"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "your activity data may look very"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "different when you are standing"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "still."}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "Similarly, if you have different"}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "gestures, gaming controls, or"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "different sports movement."}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "Your activity data could also be"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "distinctive enough to be"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "recognized."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "So what is Activity"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "Classification?"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "It is a task that allows you to"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "recognize your pre-defined set"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "of physical actions that you do"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "with your devices."}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "Then what if you have a"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "different set of activities to"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "recognize or your app may have a"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "different need. We think it will be really great"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "if you could customize your own"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "model for your own purpose and"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "that's exactly what we are"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "introducing this year, Activity"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "Classification in Create ML."}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "Perhaps, let's start with an"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "example."}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "I really love to go out and play"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "ultimate frisbee with my family"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "and friends."}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "So after a whole game, I'm also"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "very interested to see how well"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "I might have performed such as"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "what they types of throwing"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "techniques and how many of them."}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "So I trained a Frisbee Motion"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "Classifier to recognize my moves"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "and I use it on my watch."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "I think it's going to be fine."}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "Let's see a live demo first."}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "So this is the screen of my"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "phone which is paired with my"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "watch."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "So my model is going to run on"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "my watch."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "You can see a Start button here."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "So once I hit a Start button, my"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "watch is going to start"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "streaming the sensor data."}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "And then my model is going to"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "make continuous predictions."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "So let's get started."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "Now it asks me to try a frisbee"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "move which means it predicts a"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "no activity class which is true"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "for now."}, {"start": 220.0, "text": "Let me try something simple"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "first."}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "Forehand."}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "And next, Backhand."}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "And this is my favorite one."}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "Chicken Wing."}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "I also have a fancier and secret"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "one to show."}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "Bowling."}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "It's called Bowler but as if I'm"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "playing bowling."}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "Let me try that again."}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "Bowler."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "Yeah, it's machine learning models."}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "Now, let me hit the Stop button"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "and see my results."}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "Looks like pretty okay to me."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "For certain classes like Bowler,"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "I know I can always go back and"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "collect more data."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "So I'm pretty fine with this."}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "Very good exercise for today."}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "Now, let's come back and I know"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "you as developers may have lots"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "of other more creative ideas to"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "explore."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "So now let's see how could we"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "truly set your model in Create"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "ML."}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "Just the three steps."}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "First, collect some data for"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "your own activities."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "Train the model using Create ML."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "And finally, deploy the model to"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "your app."}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "Let's get some data first."}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "The easiest way to access sensor"}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "data is to use Core Motion."}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "For more information, please"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "refer to our previous sessions"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "as well as Apple Developers"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "Documentation."}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "But from a high-level point of"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "view your app could simply"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "access a list of the sensors."}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "So Core Motion Framework."}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "You can also manipulate the"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Start, Stop, or Set Update"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "Intervals from your app for your"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "recordings."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "And you can also use exactly the"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "same mechanism for both your"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "training data collection as well"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "as your later on device"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "inference."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "And here is how my data look"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "like."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "This is one of my Forehand"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "recordings, which is in a CSV"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "format."}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "There's one column of Time"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "Stamps and several other columns"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "of the sensor features."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "I actually used both User"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "Acceleration and Rotation Grade"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "for my frisbee motion example."}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "But here for simplicity only"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "three are listed."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "And if they would like to take"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "one step further to look into"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "the data, this is how the"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "activity patterns may look like."}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "My Forehand recording has three"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "back to back moves in the same"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "class."}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "And later during training, the"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "deep learning model is going to"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "use a sliding window to move"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "through this time series data."}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "And in this way, it could"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "extract both your spatial and"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "temporal patterns of the"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "activities."}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "Now we have the files ready."}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "You could simply organize your"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "data in such a hierarchy of data"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "source, where each folder's name"}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "is a Label name."}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "And all the files under this"}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "folder belongs to the same"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "activity."}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "We support CSV,JSON , and"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "text formats."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "You could choose either one of"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "them or if you like, you can mix"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "and match."}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "There's a data ready."}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "Now let's start printing."}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "Simply select Activity Class"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "from our template from the"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "Create ML app."}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "And now this is a standard info"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "screen where you could drag and"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "drop your training data into the"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "window."}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "For Activity, you can see a"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "preview of how many files and"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "how many samples in your"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "recordings."}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "The one special step above the"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "Activity is that you have to"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "tell Create ML what are the"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "sensor features you'd like to"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "try out."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "Simply select one or a few from"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "this list."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "And all these sensor features"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "actually come from your own"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "files, the headers of your CSV"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "files."}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "Optionally, you could choose to"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "adjust the parameters as well"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "such as this Prediction Window"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "Size based on how fast and slow"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "of your activities."}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "For my frisbee motion example, I"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "actually used the two second"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "window, which is 100 samples."}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "So I put 100 here and that's"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "because my data was initially"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "sampled at a 50 hertz frequency."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "Now, let's hit the Train button"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "and we can start training from"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "here."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "I'm sure you have seen this"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "whole process several times"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "during the week."}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "I'm going to skip this because"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "the whole workflow from here is"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "exactly the same as other models"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "in Create ML."}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "If you are satisfied with your"}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "accuracies, you could move on"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "and try some new data to"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "evaluate the performance of this"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "This is a standard testing tab."}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "Just supply your testing data"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "the same way you just did."}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "And after the evaluation, you"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "would see a table of your per"}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "class matrix in terms of"}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "precision and recall."}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "For my frisbee motion example,"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "you can see here, Bowler and"}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "Hammer, these certain classes"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "are not that perfect."}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "So this perhaps means I need to"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "go back and collect more data"}, {"start": 655.0, "text": "for these classes. And iterate again, so we"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "can improve the performance."}, {"start": 663.0, "text": "And finally, we get a train"}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "model and from this point, you"}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "could choose either save the"}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "model and deploy it to our app"}, {"start": 673.0, "text": "or you can do batch predictions"}, {"start": 676.0, "text": "in Create ML app on your Mac"}, {"start": 679.0, "text": "directly here."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "Simply add some new unseen"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "and unlabeled the data into the"}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "window and you will see"}, {"start": 690.0, "text": "immediate prediction results in"}, {"start": 693.0, "text": "terms of Label Name, Confidence,"}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "and also a preview of your"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "Activity Data so you could have"}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "a better understanding of your"}, {"start": 702.0, "text": "activities."}, {"start": 706.0, "text": "And finally, this is my Core ML model."}, {"start": 710.0, "text": "My Frisbee Motion Example is"}, {"start": 714.0, "text": "a Neural Network classifier."}, {"start": 716.0, "text": "With only 1.1 megabyte which is"}, {"start": 719.0, "text": "pretty small and very simple for"}, {"start": 721.0, "text": "mobile devices."}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "In addition, you could also see"}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "a complete list of all the"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "sensor features you have used in"}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "training, as well as a"}, {"start": 736.0, "text": "Prediction Window size."}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "So later for your own device"}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "inference, you could simply use"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "the same data, same size to keep"}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "consistent."}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "And this is Create ML app."}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "We also have the framework in macOS."}, {"start": 755.0, "text": "So you could automate this whole"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "process by using Xcode"}, {"start": 760.0, "text": "Playground, Swift Script, or"}, {"start": 764.0, "text": "Command Line Tools."}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "Like this."}, {"start": 771.0, "text": "The one special step above"}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "Activity is that you have to"}, {"start": 776.0, "text": "specify the selectedSensors."}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "And other than this, the rest of"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "the workflow is standard and is"}, {"start": 783.0, "text": "the same with other models we"}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "have,"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "where each training evaluation"}, {"start": 789.0, "text": "and model saving is just a one"}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "line of code for each."}, {"start": 797.0, "text": "And this is how we view an"}, {"start": 799.0, "text": "activity classifier in Create"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "ML."}, {"start": 803.0, "text": "But additionally, I'd also love"}, {"start": 805.0, "text": "to share a few better practices"}, {"start": 807.0, "text": "for this model."}, {"start": 812.0, "text": "Understand your activities."}, {"start": 815.0, "text": "Use the relevant sensors, such"}, {"start": 818.0, "text": "as Accelerometer and Gyroscope,"}, {"start": 820.0, "text": "are very common for motion-based"}, {"start": 823.0, "text": "tasks."}, {"start": 826.0, "text": "It will be also helpful to"}, {"start": 829.0, "text": "collect some data for additional"}, {"start": 831.0, "text": "no activity or other class."}, {"start": 835.0, "text": "This is especially helpful for"}, {"start": 837.0, "text": "your runtime performance."}, {"start": 843.0, "text": "Providing balanced classes is"}, {"start": 845.0, "text": "also good practice."}, {"start": 847.0, "text": "For activity, this is in terms"}, {"start": 849.0, "text": "of both number of recording files and the"}, {"start": 851.0, "text": "recording length for each class."}, {"start": 856.0, "text": "And finally, Core Motion"}, {"start": 861.0, "text": "provides both raw sensor data"}, {"start": 863.0, "text": "and processed device motion"}, {"start": 865.0, "text": "data."}, {"start": 867.0, "text": "Device motion is a sensor fusion"}, {"start": 869.0, "text": "under Core Motion Framework, and"}, {"start": 872.0, "text": "it provides some additional"}, {"start": 874.0, "text": "normalization, time alignment,"}, {"start": 878.0, "text": "or bias removal."}, {"start": 880.0, "text": "So sometimes it could be really"}, {"start": 882.0, "text": "helpful for you to process the"}, {"start": 886.0, "text": "data."}]}
